 <h3><u>Main karbobala hu</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Karbala naam hai mera..(3)</p> 
  <p>karbala, maut ke saaye ko nigal sakti hai<br> karbala, takht ko talwo se masal sakti hai<br> karbala, khaak to kya aag pe chal sakti hai<br> karbala, waqt ki raftaar badal sakti hai<br> khusrawi jabr yaha kaash nahi kar sakti..(2)<br> karbala taaj ko bardash nahi kar sakti</p> 
  <p>mai karbobala karbobala karbobala hu, mai karbobala hu</p> 
  <p>kab bhala sabko..(2)<br> mayassar hai musalla mera<br> naam shabbir ne rakha hai mu'alla mera</p> 
  <p>mai karbobala karbobala karbobala hu, mai karbobala hu</p> 
  <p>1. Rabbe qudrat ki tarashi hui tasweer hu mai<br> qismat e hurr ki qasam katib e taqdeer hu mai<br> khud pe maghroor hu abbas ki jageer hu mai<br> markaz e noor hu ash shams ki tasweer hu mai<br> ho nahi sakta mere noor ka humsar suraj<br> mere aaghosh me utre hai bahattar suraj</p> 
  <p>2. Baar nabiyo ki amanat ka uthaya maine<br> apne zarro ko sitaro se badhaya maine<br> aise darbaar shahadat ka sajaya maine<br> farsh par arsh nasheeno ko bulaya maine<br> beijazat yaha se koi rehbar guzra<br> har nabi khums lahu ka mujhe dekar guzra</p> 
  <p>3. Mujhko zehno ke marizo ki dawa aati hai<br> mere zarro se analhaq ki sada aati hai<br> sajda karne meri chaukhat pe qaza aati hai<br> bus meri khaak se khushbu e wafa aati hai<br> jab se abbase ke..(2) parcham ko utha rakha hai<br> aasmano ne mujhe sar pe bitha rakha hai</p> 
  <p>4. Qabr me jab bhi utarti hai kisi ki mayyat<br> hukm e mabood se hota hai fishare turbat<br> mere malik ne mujhe bakshi hai aisi quwat<br> mai kafan me jo rahu khake shifa ki surat<br> sakhtiyo se use turbat ki chhuda deti hu<br> mai azadaar ko jalne se bacha leti hai</p> 
  <p>5. Toor par musa ne bus ek jhalak dekhi thi<br> hai mujassam yaha maujood husain ibn e ali<br> meri mitti ko bhala toor se nisbat kesi<br> baate karne waha allah se jaate the nabi<br> meri sarhad me ye qanoon badal jaata hai<br> yaha shabbir se milne ko khuda aata hai</p> 
  <p>6. Maine abbas ke qadmo se wafaen leli<br> apne qabze me zamane ki hawaen leli<br> rehmato ne meri badh badh ke balaen leli<br> meri mitti ne jo zehra ki duaen leli<br> raat din mojize is waaste hote hai yahan<br> shabe ashoor ke jaage hue sote hai yahan</p> 
  <p>7. Meri meraj ki tareekh hai ek sath(61) hijri<br> wo jo sadiyo se bechaini meri khatm hui<br> meri taqdeer ne hurr ki tarah karwat badli<br> maine mangi thi jo daulat mujhe shabbir ne di<br> ab meri khaak kisi..(2)&nbsp; taaj ki mohtaaj nahi<br> sheh ki na'layn se badhkar to koi taaj nahi</p> 
  <p>8. Ibne zehra ne takallum mere badle halaat<br> hai meri raah se lipti hui ab raahe nijaat<br> takhte bilqees bani hai mere zarro ki zakaat<br> ek pyaase ne pilaya hai mujhe aabe hayaat<br> mere waadi pe qayamat na giraega khuda<br> jaisi hu hashr me wesa hi uthaega khuda</p> 
  <p>Karbala naam hai mera..(3)</p> 
